  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuberculosis - Myanmar (01-Jan-2017-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar, Tuberculosis, Save the Children Federation, Inc. (STC HQ)This program has the following goals: To End the TB epidemic in Myanmar (Fewer than 10 cases per 100,000 population by 2035). The objectives of this program are: Objective 1: accelerate the decline in the prevalence of drug-sensitive and drug-resistant TB.  Objective 2: fully integrate TB prevention and care in Universal Health Coverage.  Objective 3: enhance the prevention of TB, particularly for high-risk populations</narrative>
  </description>
